","B003","root_001700","B003","resolved_source_exact"]],"review_columns":["anchor_key","source_path","line","ayah_ref","raw_excerpt"],"review_rows":[["a-s075-0001","v12/runs/s075/full_context_control/reader_s075_a_ayah_walk.md",497,"75:35","3. **Turning away produces an outcome that turns back upon the subject.** The same root supplied `تَوَلَّىٰ` as withdrawal in 75:32 (B007); here B013 permits directed assignment. The structural reversal is from the subject turning away to consequence being directed “to you.” The abductive arrow is retributive: rejected orientation does not prevent relation but changes its mode. The root’s return makes withdrawal answerable."],["a-s075-0002","v12/runs/s075/full_context_control/reader_s075_a_ayah_walk.md",497,"75:35","3. **Turning away produces an outcome that turns back upon the subject.** The same root supplied `تَوَلَّىٰ` as withdrawal in 75:32 (B007); here B013 permits directed assignment. The structural reversal is from the subject turning away to consequence being directed “to you.” The abductive arrow is retributive: rejected orientation does not prevent relation but changes its mode. The root’s return makes withdrawal answerable."],["a-s075-0014","v12/runs_11ayah/s075/full_context_control/reader_s075_a_ayah_walk.md",184,"75:14","2. **The human as the very evidence he perceives.** **Lexical evidence:** `نَفْس` also activates `ن ف س/B012`, “the very thing itself,” while `ٱلْإِنسَٰن` activates `ء ن س/B002`, perceiving something into awareness. **Structural cue:** 75:16-19 distinguishes impulsive tongue-motion from gathered recitation and subsequent clarification. **Assigned role:** `B012` collapses distance between person and case; perception then receives a clarification whose referent is the person himself. **Abductive move:** I infer that explanation does not merely address an external object but renders the subject self-identical with the evidence. **Reading change:** `الإنسان على نفسه بصيرة` reads as “the human himself is a perceptible proof against himself,” not only as possession of private knowledge."]]}
